   "text": "Over solid ground, a bronze shield just thuds. But over a hollow tunnel, every pick striking below makes it ring like a bell. So wherever it rang, the defenders dug straight down and broke into the tunnel from above. An army spent months digging in secret, and a shield lying in the dirt heard every swing.",
